    "summary": "Record a Teams Meeting Join the meeting click on the \"More Actions\" icon (three dots) in the control bar. Select \"Start Recording\". (All participants will be notified that recording has started) To stop recording, click \"More Actions\" again and select \"Stop Re",
    "text": "Record a Teams Meeting Join the meeting click on the \"More Actions\" icon (three dots) in the control bar. Select \"Start Recording\". (All participants will be notified that recording has started) To stop recording, click \"More Actions\" again and select \"Stop Recording\". After the meeting ends, the recording will be processed. You'll receive a notification in the meeting chat when it's ready"
